-- One-shot installer for the Supabase SQL Editor: db/admin-console.sql then db/admin-console-seed.sql,
-- each statement base64-wrapped so the editor's statement splitter cannot cut the function bodies.
-- Runs in one transaction: if anything fails, nothing changes.
